  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c1a2f9ab33e780cba5010b6de702b28619de1d1b1c922808fce2123379d05d37.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) + and -**\n\n→ 48 + 96 × __**4 ÷ 3**__ - 58 = 34 \n\n→ 48 + __**96 × 4/3**__ - 58 = 34\n\n→ __**48 + 128**__ - 58 = 34\n\n→ 176 - 58 = 34\n\n→ 118 ≠ 34\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n<span data-d",
